    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n82469" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περι-φλεύω</span></b>  or <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περι-φλύω</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ῡ]</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>scorch, singe</i>, or <i>char all round</i>,
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοὺς ζῶντας περιφλύει</span>, of
			lightning, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Nu.</u>
				396
			</span></i> :—
				Pass.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τειχέων περιπεφλευσμένων πυρί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					5.77
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γαλῆ -φλευσθεῖσα</span>
				(v.l. -<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φλεχθεῖσα</span>) <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				2.25
			</span></i>; cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περιφλοίζω</span>.</div>
